Package: GSE280465
Type: Package
Title: GSE280465 EPICv2 Methylation ExperimentHub Data
Version: 0.99.0
Date: 2026-07-05
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Paul",
    family = "Ruiz Pinto",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "ruizpint@qut.edu.au",
    comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0007-6714-3566"))
Description: Provides ExperimentHub access to a processed DNA methylation
    resource derived from GEO accession GSE280465. The resource contains adult
    Illumina Infinium MethylationEPIC version 2 data from 163 samples across
    four tissue types, represented as a RangedSummarizedExperiment with beta,
    M, and CN assays, hg38 genomic ranges, and sample phenotype metadata.
URL: https://github.com/paulYRP/GSE280465
